<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Jefferson Park by South Breitenbush Trail 3375</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:230-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.742836" lon="-121.889526"><ele>924.5</ele><name>Trail 3375 trailhead on Road 4685</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:south-breitenbush-trailhead-3375 (= OSM 'South Breitenbush Trailhead' parking, way 148399134); USFS 3375 BMP 0 is 80 m E; confidence: high; pdf_page: 232; book_elev_ft: 3100; quote: Follow 4685 4.7 miles to a road bend where Trail 3375 starts at 3,100 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.724310" lon="-121.822390"><ele>1820.6</ele><name>Crest above Jefferson Park (northwest rim)</name><desc>source: highest point of USFS trail 3375 (DEM 5,973 ft) at 4.22 mi, where the trail tops the ridge and drops toward the park (Park Lake 44.7123,-121.8128 about 270 ft lower); confidence: low; pdf_page: 233; quote: Follow the trail 6 miles to the northwest rim of Jeff Park, which lies only 200 feet below you, an easy descent</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.714700" lon="-121.804000"><ele>1793.2</ele><name>Jefferson Park (trail 3375 meets the PCT)</name><desc>source: end of USFS trail 3375 (EMP 6.1) at the Pacific Crest Trail in Jefferson Park (OSM heath 'Jefferson Park', Russell Lake 350 m E); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 232; quote: Jefferson Park is an idyllic parkland at the north foot of craggy Mount Jefferson</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Jefferson Park by South Breitenbush Trail 3375</name><desc>1. Trail 3375 trailhead on Road 4685 -&gt; Crest above Jefferson Park (northwest rim): usfs-trail (high), 4.27 mi | 2. Crest above Jefferson Park (northwest rim) -&gt; Jefferson Park (trail 3375 meets the PCT): usfs-trail (medium), 1.65 mi</desc>
